  "processing": [
    "diffuse-field equalization: inverse of the mean power spectrum of all 8802 directions and both ears, third-octave smoothed, shape limited to +-12 dB between 100 Hz and 16000 Hz and held flat outside",
    "minimum phase per filter, delayed by its time of arrival: the near ear by cross-correlation with its minimum-phase version, the far ear by the interaural cross-correlation below 1500 Hz",
    "mirror pairs symmetrized in power and arrival time",
    "common onset trimmed, truncated to 256 taps with a 32-sample half-Hann fade",
    "asserted: each filter keeps 99.5% of its energy; the front pair near ear peaks within 8 samples"
  ],
